  "bodyHash": "d4d818c7a7b27ea5",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"朋友&amp;敵人\" width=\"836\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為贊助者\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">《朋友與敵人》模組將生物投票中落選且被遺忘的生物加入了遊戲。主要目標之一是進一步擴展原始概念，並為所有生物新增類似原版的功能。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 頁面，查看已實作生物與功能的詳細概覽。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:33px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">&nbsp;&nbsp;螃蟹</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">隆重介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>，一種在紅樹林沼澤與海灘上悠閒漫步的友善生物。想要延長觸碰範圍嗎？蟹鉤可用來製作藥水，提升您的觸及距離，為冒險帶來寶貴的優勢。若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這隻小家伙，您需要海帶與耐心，因為螃蟹必須將卵「埋」在安全的地方。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" alt=\"揮動的螃蟹\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" alt=\"攀爬紅樹林的螃蟹\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與螃蟹相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\" rel=\"nofollow\">蟹鉤</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\" rel=\"nofollow\">延伸</a> 狀態效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:41px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;凝灰岩傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">凝灰岩傀儡</a> 是一種造型優美的生物，能手持並展示您給予的任何物品，但請小心，當它未睡覺時，它很喜歡來場說走就走的散步。希望凝灰岩傀儡待在原處？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 把它固定住就好。若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 這隻沉睡的美人，請準備一組凝灰岩、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\" rel=\"nofollow\">顏色</a> 的羊毛與南瓜。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"手持附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"熟睡的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"搗蛋鬼\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;搗蛋鬼</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">探索 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\" rel=\"nofollow\">搗蛋鬼</a>，這種調皮的小生物棲息於礦坑中，以捉迷藏為樂。它們既愛玩又熱心，在您尋找時會提供線索。找到它三次，它就會獎勵您夢寐以求的包裹！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" alt=\"礦坑中的搗蛋鬼\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" alt=\"丟出包裹的搗蛋鬼\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;銅傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">認識 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡</a>，這是一個巴掌大、充滿喜感的奇妙生物，樂於隨機按下銅製按鈕。與其他銅製品一樣，它會隨時間 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\" rel=\"nofollow\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，保養非常輕鬆！想快速翻新，拿起 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\" rel=\"nofollow\">斧頭</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 即可。若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">製造</a> 這隻小家伙，請準備銅塊、南瓜與避雷針。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"銅傀儡群\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與銅傀儡相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡工作站</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅按鈕</a> 的所有銅製品變體</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\" rel=\"nofollow\">避雷針</a> 的所有銅製品變體</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"閃光苔怪\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;閃光苔怪</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">隆重介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">閃光苔怪</a>，一種居住在繁茂洞穴中、性格暴躁卻可愛且厭惡黑暗的苔蘚夥伴。您也討厭黑暗嗎？如果是的話，閃光苔怪能為您標示出足以生成怪物的暗區。若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\" rel=\"nofollow\">馴服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這隻小家伙，您需要發光莓果，但請小心，閃光苔怪會定期偷吃，不會留下剩餘的。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" alt=\"幼體與成體的閃光苔怪\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" alt=\"飛翔於繁茂洞穴中的閃光苔怪\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;冰術師</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">邂逅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師</a>，一位獨自深居雪地的孤獨災厄村民。您可以在樹林中尋找一座小型雲杉木 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">小屋</a> 來發現他。但在冒險時請多加小心，長年野外生活讓他的心比周遭的冰塊還要冰冷。若被他察覺，請準備好應對 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰霜攻擊</a>，這將使您的冒險化為一場嚴寒挑戰。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" alt=\"雪地中的冰術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" alt=\"攻擊村民的冰術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">與冰術師相關的其他功能：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師小屋</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">寒冰圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"繁花牛\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;繁花牛</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">隆重推出 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁花牛</a>，一種沐浴在陽光下、身披美麗花朵的牛，主要棲息於繁花森林。這些身披鮮花的夥伴不僅賞心悅目，還能與蜜蜂產生和諧的互動。當它們穿行時，繁花牛會留下一串盛開的植物軌跡，將每一步都化為探索自然奇觀的迷人旅程。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" alt=\"金盞花繁花牛\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" alt=\"花卉繁花牛\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與牛花相關的內容：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\" rel=\"nofollow\">金盞花</a></li>\n<li>所有木質變體的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂箱</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人區域</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人</a> 村民職業</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;野火</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，由四面盾牌環繞守護。這次遭遇戰並不輕鬆，請注意它飛散的盾牌碎片與震地衝擊波攻擊。被逼入絕境時，它會召喚烈焰人作為援軍。征服這項挑戰，在它的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">堡壘</a> 領地中運用策略對抗這名熾熱哨兵。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" alt=\"地獄中的堡壘結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" alt=\"堡壘中的野火\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與野火相關的內容：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">堡壘</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"巨噬者\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;巨噬者（大飢餓）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨噬者</a>，一種在草原、惡地與沙漠遊蕩的微型掠食者。它們正在四處尋找雞、兔子等獵物。你可以餵食它們附魔食物來 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再使用瓶子提取。但請小心，儲存的經驗值越多，巨噬者就會變得越大、越飢餓！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" alt=\"巨噬者狩獵雞隻\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" alt=\"餵飽的巨噬者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;幻術師</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師</a>，一位手持弓箭、狡詐多變的騙術大師，棲息於針葉林。你可以透過搜尋一間小木屋或他的訓練場來找到他。請謹慎靠近，因為他的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\" rel=\"nofollow\">致盲咒語</a> 可能會讓你陷入黑暗，難以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻影</a> 與現實。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" alt=\"針葉林中的幻術師小木屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">其他與幻術師相關的內容：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師小木屋</a> 結構</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻影圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;殭屍馬（陷阱）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">曾經想騎乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍馬</a> 嗎？如果是的話，在雷暴天氣時靠近它，奇蹟可能會發生 &ndash; 你甚至可能瞥見四位騎士的身影。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" alt=\"雷暴中的殭屍馬\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" alt=\"雷暴中的四位騎士\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 相容性 / 擴充套件</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">《Friends & Foes》設計為與所有其他模組完全相容，目前提供以下擴充套件與數據包：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends & Foes - 繁花牛花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends & Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends & Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTOV - Friends & Foes 相容數據包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a> 進行交流、分享作品、提出問題，或單純追蹤模組的最新開發進度並在新版本發布時收到通知。也請不吝透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支援</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">我會將開發模組視為興趣持續進行，因為我真心熱愛這項工作。如果您希望支持我，可以透過 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 進行贊助。非常感謝您的支持。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎隨意瀏覽我的原始碼，參考我在開發此模組時如何應對並解決各種挑戰。您可以自由將程式碼片段融入自己的專案中。也歡迎在任何整合包中使用本模組（若能標註作者或連結回此頁面將不勝感激）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">您也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">blockbench 目錄</a>，其中包含所有模型與配色；以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">textures 目錄</a> 中的貼圖。歡迎以此獲得靈感，但請勿直接複製貼上並宣稱是自己製作。</p>",
